ler)e ba\u011fl\u0131"],"label\u0004all products allowed to be redeemed":["kullan\u0131labilen t\u00fcm \u00fcr\u00fcnler"],"You can add comma separated \",\" product ids. This will limit the user to redeem tickets only of products listed here. If left empty, all are allowed.":["Virg\u00fclle ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015f \",\" \u00fcr\u00fcn kimlikleri ekleyebilirsiniz. Bu, kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n yaln\u0131zca burada listelenen \u00fcr\u00fcnlerin biletlerini kullanmas\u0131na izin verir. Bo\u015f b\u0131rak\u0131l\u0131rsa t\u00fcm\u00fcne izin verilir."],"label\u0004Bound to ticket list(s)":[""],"label\u0004all ticket lists allowed to be redeemed":[""],"You can add comma separated \",\" ticket list ids. This will limit the user to redeem tickets of these lists only. If left empty, all are allowed. This is the only restriction that works for tickets without an order, because those have no product.":[""],"label\u0004Description":["A\u00e7\u0131klama"],"label\u0004is active":["etkin"],"label\u0004Created":["Olu\u015fturuldu"],"label\u0004Area":["Alan"],"label\u0004Status":["Durum"],"label\u0004Edit":["D\u00fczenle"],"label\u0004Delete":["Sil"],"title\u0004Do you want to delete?":["Silmek istiyor musunuz?"],"Are you sure, you want to delete this auth token?":["Bu kimlik do\u011frulama belirtecini silmek istedi\u011finizden emin misiniz?"],"The user with this auth token will not be able to use the server anymore. The user will need to add a new auth token from you.<p>The effect will be immediately.<\/p>":["Bu kimlik belirtecine sahip kullan\u0131c\u0131 art\u0131k sunucuyu kullanamayacakt\u0131r. Kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n sizden yeni bir kimlik belirteci eklemesi gerekecektir.<p>Etki hemen ge\u00e7erli olacakt\u0131r.<\/p>"],"label\u0004Bound to ticket list":[""],"label\u0004all ticket lists":[""],"Status":["Durum"],"Not checked yet":["Hen\u00fcz kontrol edilmedi"],"Expired":["S\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f"],"Last successful check":["Son ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131 kontrol"],"