"],"title\u0004Select Media":["Ortam Se\u00e7"],"label\u0004Back":["Geri"],"label\u0004Support Info":["Destek Bilgisi"],"label\u0004FAQ":["SSS"],"label\u0004Ticket Scanner":["Bilet Taray\u0131c\u0131"],"label\u0004Attendance":["Kat\u0131l\u0131m"],"label\u0004Congresses":["Kongreler"],"label\u0004Options":["Se\u00e7enekler"],"label\u0004Enter a prefix (optional)":["Bir \u00f6nek girin (iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131)"],"You can use date placeholder to have the prefix filled with the date of the confirmed purchase.":["On eki onaylanan satin alma tarihiyle doldurmak icin tarih yer tutucusunu kullanabilirsiniz."],"You can use: {Y} = year, {m} = month, {d} = day, {H} = hour, {i} = minutes, {s} = seconds, {TIMESTAMP} = unix timestamp.":["\u015eunlar\u0131 kullanabilirsiniz: {Y} = y\u0131l, {m} = ay, {d} = g\u00fcn, {H} = saat, {i} = dakika, {s} = saniye, {TIMESTAMP} = unix zaman damgas\u0131."],"label\u0004Choose type of ticket numbers":["Bilet numaras\u0131 t\u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fc se\u00e7in"],"option value\u0004Serials":["Seri Numaralar\u0131"],"option value\u0004Numbers":["Numaralar"],"title\u0004Serials options":["Seri numaras\u0131 se\u00e7enekleri"],"label\u0004Amount of letter needed":["Gereken harf say\u0131s\u0131"],"label\u0004Letter exclusion":["Harf \u00e7\u0131karma"],"option value\u0004None":["Hi\u00e7biri"],"label\u0004Letter style":["Harf stili"],"option value\u0004Uppercase":["B\u00fcy\u00fck harf"],"option value\u0004Lowercase":["K\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck harf"],"option value\u0004Both":["\u0130kisi de"],"label\u0004Numbers needed?":["Numaralar gerekli mi?"],"label\u0004No":["Hay\u0131r"],"label\u0004Yes":["Evet"],"option value\u0004Only numbers":["Yaln\u0131zca numaralar"],"label\u0004Delimiter?":["Ay\u0131r\u0131c\u0131?"],"option value\u0004Space":["Bo\u015fluk"],"label\u0004After how many letters?":["Ka\u00e7 harften sonra?"],"title\u0004Numbers options":["Numara se\u00e7enekleri"],"label\u0004Start number":["Ba\u015flang\u0131\u00e7 numaras\u0131"],"label\u0004Offset for each number":["Her numara i\u00e7in fark"],"Amount of letters has to be higher":["Harf sayisi daha yuksek olmalidir"],"Your start number is not correct. It has to be an integer bigger than 0":["Ba\u015flang\u0131\u00e7 numaran\u0131z do\u011fru de\u011fil. 0'dan b\u00fcy\u00fck bir tam say\u0131 olmal\u0131"],"You have PDF ticket attachment enabled for emails.":["E-postalar i\u00e7in PDF bilet eki etkinle\u015ftirdiniz."],"Do you also want to attach the ICS calendar file to the purchase emails?":["ICS takvim dosyas\u0131n\u0131 da sat\u0131n alma e-postalar\u0131na eklemek istiyor musunuz?"],"Do you also want to include a \"Download all tickets as one PDF\" link in the email?":["E-postaya \"T\u00fcm biletleri tek PDF olarak indir\" ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 da eklemek istiyor musunuz?"],"You show the badge download button on the ticket detail page.":["Bilet detay sayfas\u0131nda badge indirme d\u00fc\u011fmesini g\u00f6sterirsiniz."],"Do you also want to include the badge download link in the purchase emails?":["Rozet indirme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 da sat\u0131n alma e-postalar\u0131na eklemek istiyor musunuz?"],"You have hidden the PDF download button on purchase emails.":["Sat\u0131n alma e-postalar\u0131ndaki PDF indirme d\u00fc\u011fmesini gizlediniz."],"Do you want to show the \"View all tickets\" link in the email instead?":["Bunun yerine e-postada \"T\u00fcm biletleri g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle\" ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6stermek ister misiniz?"],"You have auto-start camera enabled for the ticket scanner.":["Bilet taray\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 i\u00e7in otomatik kamera ba\u015flatmay\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirdiniz."],"Do you also want to enable automatic ticket redemption on scan?":["Tarat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda otomatik bilet kullan\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 da etkinle\u015ftirmek istiyor musunuz?"],"You have automatic scan-and-redeem enabled.":["Otomatik tarama ve kullanma etkin."],"Do you also want to enable haptic feedback (vibration) when a ticket is scanned?":["Bir bilet tarand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda dokunsal geri bildirimi (titre\u015fim) de etkinle\u015ftirmek istiyor musunuz?"],"You allow tickets to be redeemed after the event end date.":["Biletlerin etkinlik biti\u015f tarihinden sonra kullan\u0131lmas\u0131na izin veriyorsunuz."],"Do you also want to display the confirmed scan count on the ticket scanner?":["Onaylanan tarama say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 da bilet taray\u0131c\u0131s\u0131nda g\u00f6stermek istiyor musunuz?"],"You show the event date on the purchase order email.":["Sipari\u015f e-postas\u0131nda etkinlik tarihini g\u00f6sterirsiniz."],"Do you also want to show the event date on the product detail page?":["Etkinlik tarihini de \u00fcr\u00fcn detay sayfas\u0131nda g\u00f6stermek istiyor musunuz?"],"You show input fields on the checkout page.":["\u00d6deme sayfas\u0131nda giri\u015f alanlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6sterirsiniz."],"Do you also want to display the customer note on the ticket PDF?":["M\u00fc\u015fteri notunu da bilet PDF'inde g\u00f6stermek istiyor musunuz?"],"You show the self-redeem button on the ticket detail page.":["Bilet detay sayfas\u0131nda kendin kullan d\u00fc\u011fmesini g\u00f6sterirsiniz."],"Do you also want to redirect the customer after they redeem their ticket?":["M\u00fc\u015fteri biletini kulland\u0131ktan sonra y\u00f6nlendirmek istiyor musunuz?"],"You have the premium plugin active.":["Premium eklentiniz etkin."],"Do you want to enable IP blocking to protect against brute-force ticket validation attempts?":["Kaba kuvvet bilet do\u011frulama denemelerine kar\u015f\u0131 korumak i\u00e7in IP engellemeyi etkinle\u015ftirmek istiyor musunuz?"],"Do you want to enable IP tracking for ticket validation requests?":["Bilet do\u011frulama istekleri i\u00e7in IP izlemeyi etkinle\u015ftirmek istiyor musunuz?"],"Your customers can collect their tickets in the free Vollstart Wallet app.":["M\u00fc\u015fterileriniz biletlerini \u00fccretsiz Vollstart C\u00fczdan uygulamas\u0131nda toplayabilir."],"Do you want to enable the \"Add to Vollstart Wallet\" button on ticket pages and in emails?":["Bilet sayfalar\u0131nda ve e-postalarda \"Vollstart C\u00fczdan'a Ekle\" d\u00fc\u011fmesi etkinle\u015ftirilsin mi?"],"Eventado.com is a free public event calendar \u2014 Premium customers can list their ticket events automatically.":["Eventado.com \u00fccretsiz herkese a\u00e7\u0131k bir etkinlik takvimidir \u2014 Premium m\u00fc\u015fteriler bilet etkinliklerini otomatik olarak listeleyebilir."],"Do you want to publish your ticket events to Eventado.com for more reach and SEO?":["Bilet etkinliklerinizi daha fazla eri\u015fim ve SEO i\u00e7in Eventado.com'da yay\u0131nlamak ister misiniz?"],"Yes, enable":["Evet, etkinle\u015ftir"],"No thanks":["Hay\u0131r te\u015fekk\u00fcrler"],"Don't ask again":["Tekrar sorma"],"Dismiss":["Kapat"],"Assign list to a WooCommerce product":["Listeyi bir WooCommerce \u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fcne atay\u0131n"],"Open a product, go to the Event Ticket tab, and enable ticketing.":["Bir \u00fcr\u00fcn a\u00e7\u0131n, Event Ticket sekmesine gidin ve biletlemeyi etkinle\u015ftirin."],"Process a test order":["Test sipari\u015fi i\u015fle"],"Place an order and complete it to generate tickets.":["Bilet olu\u015fturmak i\u00e7in bir sipari\u015f verin ve tamamlay\u0131n."],"Scan a ticket at the entrance":["Giri\u015fte bir bileti okutun"],"Use the browser-based QR scanner to redeem tickets.":["Biletleri kullanmak i\u00e7in taray\u0131c\u0131 tabanl\u0131 QR taray\u0131c\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131n."],"label\u0004Open Scanner":["Taray\u0131c\u0131y\u0131 A\u00e7"],"title\u0004Getting Started":["Ba\u015flarken"],"If you need help, please contact us via email. The information is in \"Support Info\" area - button above.":["Yard\u0131ma ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z varsa l\u00fctfen e-posta yoluyla bizimle ileti\u015fime ge\u00e7in. Bilgiler yukar\u0131daki \"Destek Bilgileri\" alan\u0131nda - d\u00fc\u011fmesindedir."],"label\u0004Don't show this again":["Bunu tekrar g\u00f6sterme"],"Lock ticket redemption until event starts?":["Bilet kullan\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 etkinlik ba\u015flayana kadar kilitlensin mi?"],"Auto-redeem when scanned?":["Tarand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda otomatik kullan\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131?"],"Show \"Open Tickets\" link in email? All QR codes on one page \u2014 ideal for groups.":["E-postada \"Biletleri A\u00e7\" ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6sterilsin mi? T\u00fcm QR kodlar\u0131 tek sayfada \u2014 gruplar i\u00e7in ideal."],"Auto-complete orders when all items are tickets? Tickets are generated immediately.":["T\u00fcm \u00fcr\u00fcnler bilet oldu\u011funda sipari\u015fler otomatik tamamlans\u0131n m\u0131? Biletler an\u0131nda olu\u015fturulur."],"Enable Vollstart Wallet? Customers can collect tickets in the free wallet app.":["Vollstart C\u00fczdan etkinle\u015ftirilsin mi? M\u00fc\u015fteriler biletleri \u00fccretsiz c\u00fczdan uygulamas\u0131nda toplayabilir."],"Do you also hand out tickets that were not bought in the shop? For example printed cards. They can then be redeemed without an order \u2014 the check against a paid order does not apply to them.":[""],"Allow redemption after closing time?":["Kapan\u0131\u015f saatinden sonra kullan\u0131ma izin verilsin mi?"],"Show \"Open Tickets\" link in email? All QR codes on one page \u2014 ideal for families.":["E-postada \"Biletleri A\u00e7\" ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6sterilsin mi? T\u00fcm QR kodlar\u0131 tek sayfada \u2014 aileler i\u00e7in ideal."],"Show redemption counter to customer? E.g. \"15 of 30 visits used\"":["Kullan\u0131m sayac\u0131 m\u00fc\u015fteriye g\u00f6sterilsin mi? \u00d6rn. \"30 ziyaretten 15'i kullan\u0131ld\u0131\""],"Show self-redeem button on ticket page? For self-service access.":["Bilet sayfas\u0131nda kendin kullan d\u00fc\u011fmesi g\u00f6sterilsin mi? Kendi kendine hizmet eri\u015fimi i\u00e7in."],"Auto-redeem when scanned? Disable to verify identity first.":["Tarand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda otomatik kullan\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131? \u00d6nce kimlik do\u011frulamak i\u00e7in devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n."],"Show self-redeem button? Customer redeems the voucher themselves.":["Kendi kullan\u0131m d\u00fc\u011fmesi g\u00f6sterilsin mi? M\u00fc\u015fteri kendisi kuponu kullan\u0131r."],"Concerts, shows, festivals":["Konserler, g\u00f6steriler, festivaller"],"Theme park, zoo, spa":["Tema park\u0131, hayvanat bah\u00e7esi, spa"],"Memberships \/ Season passes":["\u00dcyelikler \/ Sezon kartlar\u0131"],"Recurring access":["Tekrarlayan eri\u015fim"],"Vouchers \/ Simple codes":["Kuponlar \/ Basit kodlar"],"Gift cards, promo codes":["Hediye kartlar\u0131, promosyon kodlar\u0131"],"Welcome to Event Tickets!":["Etkinlik Biletlerine Ho\u015f Geldiniz!"],"Let's configure your ticketing system.":["Bilet sisteminizi yap\u0131land\u0131ral\u0131m."],"This takes less than 2 minutes.":["Bu 2 dakikadan k\u0131sa s\u00fcrer."],"Skip, I'll configure manually":["Atla, manuel olarak yap\u0131land\u0131raca\u011f\u0131m"],"Start Setup":["Kurulumu Ba\u015flat"],"Back":["Geri"],"Next":["\u0130leri"],"Tip: PDF attachment to email":["\u0130pucu: E-postaya PDF eki"],"With the Premium version you can attach PDF tickets directly to the order email \u2014 as individual files or merged into one PDF.":["Premium s\u00fcr\u00fcm ile PDF biletlerini do\u011frudan sipari\u015f e-postas\u0131na ekleyebilirsiniz \u2014 ayr\u0131 dosyalar olarak veya tek bir PDF'de birle\u015ftirilmi\u015f."],"Attach all tickets as one PDF to the order email?":["T\u00fcm biletler sipari\u015f e-postas\u0131na tek PDF olarak eklensin mi?"],"Attach PDF ticket to the order email?":["PDF bilet sipari\u015f e-postas\u0131na eklensin mi?"],"Premium":["Premium"],"Apply & Finish":["Uygula ve Bitir"],"You're all set!":["Haz\u0131rs\u0131n!"],"Your settings have been configured for %s.":["Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131z %s i\u00e7in yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131."],"These settings are now active - you can change every one of them later:":[""],"One thing is still missing: a WooCommerce product that sells your tickets.":[""],"Applying settings...":["Ayarlar uygulan\u0131yor..."],"Error applying settings. Please try again.":["Ayarlar uygulan\u0131rken hata olu\u015ftu. L\u00fctfen tekrar deneyin."],"Setup Wizard":["Kurulum Sihirbaz\u0131"],"Premium Activated!":["Premium Etkinle\u015ftirildi!"],"You now have access to these features:":["Art\u0131k \u015fu \u00f6zelliklere eri\u015fiminiz var:"],"PDF ticket attachment in emails":["E-postalarda PDF bilet eki"],"Ticket Designer (custom PDF templates)":["Bilet Tasar\u0131mc\u0131s\u0131 (\u00f6zel PDF \u015fablonlar\u0131)"],"Badge printing":["Rozet yazd\u0131rma"],"Seating plans":["Oturma planlar\u0131"],"Recommended:":["\u00d6nerilen:"],"The button below switches these three settings on:":["A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki d\u00fc\u011fme bu \u00fc\u00e7 ayar\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirir:"],"Attach the tickets as PDF files to the purchase email":["Biletleri PDF dosyalar\u0131 olarak sat\u0131n alma e-postas\u0131na ekleyin"],"Merge all tickets of an order into one PDF":["Bir sipari\u015fin t\u00fcm biletlerini tek bir PDF'te birle\u015ftirin"],"Up to 21 PDF attachments per email":["E-posta ba\u015f\u0131na en fazla 21 PDF eki"],"You can change these anytime in Options.":["Bunlar\u0131 Se\u00e7enekler'den istedi\u011finiz zaman de\u011fi\u015ftirebilirsiniz."],"Enable Recommended Settings":["\u00d6nerilen Ayarlar\u0131 Etkinle\u015ftir"],"button\u0004Skip":["Atla"],"Premium settings applied!":["Premium ayarlar\u0131 uyguland\u0131!"],"PDF attachment in emails: enabled":["E-postalarda PDF eki: etkin"],"Merge into one PDF: enabled":["Tek PDF'de birle\u015ftir: etkin"],"Max attachments: 21":["Maks. ek say\u0131s\u0131: 21"],"Close":["Kapat"],"Premium Features":["Premium \u00d6zellikler"],"label\u0004Upgrade":["Y\u00fckselt"],"title\u0004Enter an amount of how many ticket numbers you need":["Ka\u00e7 adet bilet numaras\u0131na ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z oldu\u011funu girin"],"title\u00041. Ticket number generator (optional step)":["1. Bilet numaras\u0131 olu\u015fturucu (iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 ad\u0131m)"],"You can generate ticket numbers.":["Bilet numaralar\u0131 olu\u015fturabilirsiniz."],"Up 100.000 tickets generation per run. The limit is to prevent performance issues.":["\u00c7al\u0131\u015fma ba\u015f\u0131na 100.000 bilete kadar olu\u015fturma. S\u0131n\u0131r performans sorunlar\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6nlemek i\u00e7indir."],"You can repeat the \"store tickets\" operations as often as needed.":["\"Biletleri depola\" i\u015flemlerini gerekti\u011fi kadar tekrarlayabilirsiniz."],"label\u0004Enter amount of needed ticket numbers":["Gereken bilet numaras\u0131 miktar\u0131n\u0131 girin"],"%1$d max. %2$s up to 100.000 for each run":["%1$d maks. %2$s her \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma i\u00e7in 100.000'e kadar"],"label\u0004Clear the ticket numbers list textarea field below to add fill in the new generated ticket numbers":["Yeni olu\u015fturulan bilet numaralar\u0131n\u0131 eklemek i\u00e7in a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki bilet numaralar\u0131 metin alan\u0131n\u0131 temizleyin"],"label\u0004Generate Code Verification Value (CVV) for each ticket number":["Her bilet numaras\u0131 i\u00e7in Kod Do\u011frulama De\u011feri (CVV) olu\u015ftur"],"label\u0004Generate ticket numbers":["Bilet numaralar\u0131 olu\u015ftur"],"Created %1$d tickets. In %2$s seconds, with %3$d runs to find unique ticket numbers.":["%1$d bilet olu\u015fturuldu. %2$s saniyede, %3$d \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmayla benzersiz bilet numaralar\u0131 bulundu."],"contains %d tickets":["%d bilet i\u00e7erir"],"title\u00042. Ticket numbers to store on the server":["2. Sunucuda saklanacak bilet numaralar\u0131"],"One number per line and\/or comma-separated (,). <br>If you want to add the CVV number then separate your ticket number with (;) and append your CVV number.<br>While storing the numbers to the server, it will check if the ticket number is unique and mark the ones, that are not.":["Her sat\u0131ra bir numara ve\/veya virg\u00fclle ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015f (,). <br>CVV numaras\u0131n\u0131 eklemek istiyorsan\u0131z bilet numaran\u0131z\u0131 (;) ile ay\u0131r\u0131n ve CVV numaran\u0131z\u0131 ekleyin.<br>Numaralar sunucuya kaydedilirken bilet numaras\u0131n\u0131n benzersiz olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 kontrol edilir ve olmayanlar i\u015faretlenir."],"label\u0004Assign to this ticket list":["Bu bilet listesine ata"],"You can store up to %1$d. %2$s unlimited":["En fazla %1$d saklayabilirsiniz. %2$s s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z"],"label\u0004Store ticket numbers":["Bilet numaralar\u0131n\u0131 sakla"],"Each entry will turn green (successful stored) or red (NOT OK - duplicate entry on the server).<br>Scroll down and wait for all to finish.<br>In the textarea below you will find all the successful stored tickets.":["Her giri\u015f ye\u015file d\u00f6necek (ba\u015far\u0131yla kaydedildi) veya k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131ya (HATA - sunucuda kopya kay\u0131t).<br>A\u015fa\u011f\u0131 kayd\u0131r\u0131n ve t\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fcn bitmesini bekleyin.<br>A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki metin alan\u0131nda ba\u015far\u0131yla kaydedilen t\u00fcm biletleri bulacaks\u0131n\u0131z."],"title\u0004Successful stored ticket numbers":["Bilet numaralar\u0131 ba\u015far\u0131yla sakland\u0131"],"title\u0004Importing":["\u0130\u00e7e aktar\u0131l\u0131yor"],"Import process finished":["Ice aktarim islemi tamamlandi"],"title\u0004Your Limit of %d tickets is reached. Use the premium version to have unlimited tickets":["%d bilet limitinize ula\u015ft\u0131n\u0131z. S\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z bilet i\u00e7in premium s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc kullan\u0131n"],"title\u0004Amount":["Tutar"],"label\u0004Not Ok":["Tamam De\u011fil"],"title\u0004Export tickets":["Biletleri d\u0131\u015fa aktar"],"label\u0004Export":["D\u0131\u015fa Aktar"],"title\u0004Choose your export settings":["D\u0131\u015fa aktarma ayarlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 se\u00e7in"],"label\u0004Choose the delimiter for the column values":["S\u00fctun de\u011ferleri i\u00e7in ay\u0131r\u0131c\u0131y\u0131 se\u00e7in"],"option value\u0004Comma":["Virg\u00fcl"],"option value\u0004Semicolon":["Noktal\u0131 virg\u00fcl"],"option value\u0004Pipe":["Dikey \u00e7izgi"],"label\u0004Choose a file suffix":["Bir dosya soneki se\u00e7in"],"option value\u0004All":["T\u00fcm\u00fc"],"label\u0004Limit export to ticket list":["D\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131m\u0131 bilet listesiyle s\u0131n\u0131rla"],"label\u0004Choose a sorting field":["Bir s\u0131ralama alan\u0131 se\u00e7in"],"option value\u0004Creation date":["Olu\u015fturulma tarihi"],"Ticket number":["Bilet numaras\u0131"],"Ticket display number":["Bilet g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleme numaras\u0131"],"option value\u0004List name":["Liste ad\u0131"],"label\u0004Choose a sorting direction":["Bir s\u0131ralama y\u00f6n\u00fc se\u00e7in"],"option value\u0004Ascending":["Artan"],"option value\u0004Descending":["Azalan"],"label\u0004Set a range":["Bir aral\u0131k belirleyin"],"You have %d tickets stored.":["%d biletiniz depoland\u0131."],"Some systems are slow and the connection timeout interrupts the export, if you have too many tickets. In that case, you can export your tickets in several steps. e.g. 0 and 20000 amount and then 20001 and 20000 amount.":["Baz\u0131 sistemler yava\u015ft\u0131r ve ba\u011flant\u0131 zaman a\u015f\u0131m\u0131, \u00e7ok fazla biletiniz oldu\u011funda d\u0131\u015fa aktarmay\u0131 keser. Bu durumda biletlerinizi birka\u00e7 ad\u0131mda d\u0131\u015fa aktarabilirsiniz. \u00d6rne\u011fin: 0 ve 20000 adet, ard\u0131ndan 20001 ve 20000 adet."],"Enter your row start (0 = from the first)":["Satir baslangicinizi girin (0 = ilkten)"],"label\u0004Enter amount of tickets":["Bilet miktar\u0131n\u0131 girin"],"title\u0004Edit List":["Listeyi D\u00fczenle"],"title\u0004Add List":["Liste Ekle"],"Overrule %s per Ticket list":["Bilet listesi ba\u015f\u0131na %s ge\u00e7ersiz k\u0131l"],"label\u0004Overrule the ticket format settings":["Bilet format\u0131 ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 ge\u00e7ersiz k\u0131l"],"label\u0004Note":["Not"],"Will be overridden if you set the ticket number format settings on the product!":["\u00dcr\u00fcnde bilet numaras\u0131 format ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 belirlerseniz bu ge\u00e7ersiz k\u0131l\u0131n\u0131r!"],"heading\u0004Webhook":["Webhook"],"label\u0004The webhook need to be activated first in the options to be executed, even if the URL is set here.":["Webhook'un, URL burada ayarlanm\u0131\u015f olsa bile \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131labilmesi i\u00e7in \u00f6nce se\u00e7eneklerde etkinle\u015ftirilmesi gerekir."],"label\u0004URL to your service if the WooCommerce ticket is sold":["WooCommerce bileti sat\u0131l\u0131rsa servisinize giden URL."],"heading\u0004Tickets without a WooCommerce order":[""],"label\u0004Tickets of this list may exist without an order":[""],"label\u0004For numbers you generated yourself, for example printed cards. Those tickets can be opened and redeemed at the scanner without a paid order \u2014 the order check as copy protection does not apply to them. Tickets sold through WooCommerce keep the full check.":[""],"label\u0004Event window for these tickets (optional). Only used for tickets without an order \u2014 leave empty for no time limit. Whether it blocks redemption is governed by the existing scanner options.":[""],"label\u0004Until":[""],"title\u0004Edit Ticket":["Biletini D\u00fczenle"],"title\u0004Add Ticket":["Bilet Ekle"],"label\u0004List":["Liste"],"label\u0004CVV - use 4 digits for best results":["CVV - en iyi sonu\u00e7 i\u00e7in 4 hane kullan\u0131n"],"If CVV is set, then your user will be asked to enter also the CVV to check the ticket number.":["CVV ayarlanm\u0131\u015fsa, kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131zdan bilet numaras\u0131n\u0131 kontrol ederken CVV'yi de girmesi istenir."],"option value\u0004is activ":["etkin"],"option value\u0004is inactiv":["etkin de\u011fil"],"label\u0004is stolen":["\u00e7al\u0131nt\u0131"],"Use the add option":["Ekle se\u00e7ene\u011fini kullan"],"label\u0004Tickets":["Biletler"],"label\u0004Delete All Tickets":["T\u00fcm Biletleri Sil"],"Are you sure, you want to delete this list?":["Bu listeyi silmek istediginizden emin misiniz?"],"No ticket will be deleted. Just the list.":["Hi\u00e7bir bilet silinmez. Sadece liste."],"Check if list is used by products":["Listenin \u00fcr\u00fcnler taraf\u0131ndan kullan\u0131l\u0131p kullan\u0131lmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et"],"This list is still assigned to products:":["Bu liste h\u00e2l\u00e2 \u00fcr\u00fcnlere atanm\u0131\u015f:"],"Please reassign these products first, or uncheck the product check option.":["L\u00fctfen \u00f6nce bu \u00fcr\u00fcnleri yeniden atay\u0131n veya \u00fcr\u00fcn kontrol se\u00e7ene\u011finin i\u015faretini kald\u0131r\u0131n."],"Cannot delete list":["Liste silinemiyor"],"title\u0004Delete all tickets?":["T\u00fcm biletler silinsin mi?"],"Are you sure you want to delete ALL tickets from the list \"%s\"?":["\"%s\" listesindeki T\u00dcM biletleri silmek istedi\u011finizden emin misiniz?"],"This action cannot be undone!":["Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz!"],"To confirm deletion, type DELETE in the field below:":["Silme i\u015flemini onaylamak i\u00e7in a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki alana DELETE yaz\u0131n:"],"title\u0004Final confirmation":["Son onay"],"You must type DELETE to confirm.":["Onaylamak i\u00e7in DELETE yazmal\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z."],"Deleting...":["Siliniyor..."],"%d tickets have been deleted.":["%d bilet silindi."],"%1$d of %2$d":[""],"Do you want to empty the \"%s\" table? All data will be lost. No ticket will be deleted. Just the lists.":["\"%s\" tablosunu bo\u015faltmak istiyor musunuz? T\u00fcm veriler kaybolacak. Hi\u00e7bir bilet silinmeyecek. Yaln\u0131zca listeler."],"title\u0004List of tickets":["Bilet listesi"],"Are you sure? You will not be able to restore the data, except you have a backup of your database. All data will be lost. No ticket will be deleted. Just the lists.":["Emin misiniz? Veritaban\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n yede\u011fi yoksa verileri geri getiremezsiniz. T\u00fcm veriler kaybolacak. Hi\u00e7bir bilet silinmeyecek, yaln\u0131zca listeler."],"Organize your tickets in lists. You can assign tickets to a list.":["Biletlerinizi listeler halinde d\u00fczenleyin. Biletleri bir listeye atayabilirsiniz."],"Max. %1$d list. Unlimited with %2$s":["Maks. %1$d liste. %2$s ile s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z."],"label\u0004Confirmed Count":["Onaylanan Say\u0131"],"label\u0004Customer":["M\u00fc\u015fteri"],"label\u0004Company":["\u015eirket"],"label\u0004Redeem Amount":["Tutar\u0131 Kullan"],"label\u0004Order line details":[""],"label\u0004Ticket":["Bilet"],"label\u0004OrderId":["Sipari\u015fKimli\u011fi"],"You need to create a ticket list first before you can add tickets.":["Bilet ekleyebilmeniz i\u00e7in \u00f6nce bir bilet listesi olu\u015fturmal\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z."],"You reached maximum amount of tickets. You need to delete tickets before you can add more new tickets or buy the premium version to have unlimited tickets.":["Maksimum bilet say\u0131s\u0131na ula\u015ft\u0131n\u0131z. Yeni bilet ekleyebilmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce mevcut biletleri silmeniz ya da s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z bilet i\u00e7in premium s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc sat\u0131n alman\u0131z gerekiyor."],"label\u0004Export tickets":["Biletleri d\u0131\u015fa aktar"],"option value\u0004Bulk Action":["Toplu \u0130\u015flem"],"title\u0004Bulk Action":["Toplu \u0130\u015flem"],"Please select at least one ticket first.":["L\u00fctfen \u00f6nce en az bir bilet se\u00e7in."],"option value\u0004Default search filter":["Varsay\u0131lan arama filtresi"],"option value\u0004Filter for list id":["Liste kimli\u011fine g\u00f6re filtre"],"option value\u0004Filter for order id":["Sipari\u015f kimli\u011fine g\u00f6re filtre"],"option value\u0004Filter for cvv value":["CVV de\u011ferine g\u00f6re filtre"],"option value\u0004Filter for status (1:active, 0:inactive, 2:stolen)":["Duruma g\u00f6re filtre (1:aktif, 0:pasif, 2:\u00e7al\u0131nd\u0131)"],"option value\u0004Filter for redeemed status (0:not redeemed yet, 1:redeemed)":["Kullan\u0131m durumuna g\u00f6re filtre (0:hen\u00fcz kullan\u0131lmad\u0131, 1:kullan\u0131ld\u0131)"],"option value\u0004Filter for registered user id":["Kay\u0131tl\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131 kimli\u011fine g\u00f6re filtre"],"option value\u0004Filter for customer name in billing first and last name":["Fatura ad ve soyad\u0131nda m\u00fc\u015fteri ad\u0131na g\u00f6re filtre"],"option value\u0004Filter for product id":["\u00dcr\u00fcn kimli\u011fine g\u00f6re filtre"],"option value\u0004Filter for chosen date (enter YYYY-MM-DD)":["Se\u00e7ilen tarihe g\u00f6re filtre (YYYY-AA-GG girin)"],"Max. %1$d tickets. Unlimited with %2$s":["Maks. %1$d bilet. %2$s ile s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z."],"label\u0004stolen":["\u00e7al\u0131nt\u0131"],"used":["kullanildi"],"active":["aktif"],"label\u0004is inactiv":["etkin de\u011fil"],"You have no tickets yet.":["Hen\u00fcz biletiniz yok."],"Or add ticket numbers to a ticket list yourself - with the \"Add\" button above. Useful for printed cards you hand out at the door.":[""],"Redeemed tickets: %1$d (filtered) of %2$d (total redeemed tickets)":["Kullan\u0131lan biletler: %1$d (filtrelenmi\u015f) \/ %2$d (toplam kullan\u0131lan bilet)"],"Are you sure, you want to delete this ticket?":["Bu bileti silmek istedi\u011finizden emin misiniz?"],"label\u0004Display QR with ticket number":["QR'\u0131 bilet numaras\u0131yla g\u00f6ster"],"label\u0004This QR image contains":["Bu QR g\u00f6rseli \u015funlar\u0131 i\u00e7erir"],"title\u0004QR with ticket number":["Bilet numaras\u0131 i\u00e7eren QR"],"label\u0004Display QR with PUBLIC ticket number":["QR'\u0131 KAMU bilet numaras\u0131yla g\u00f6ster"],"label\u0004Can be used with the ticket scanner":["Bilet taray\u0131c\u0131 ile kullan\u0131labilir"],"label\u0004Display QR with your own QR content":["QR'\u0131 kendi QR i\u00e7eri\u011finle g\u00f6ster"],"label\u0004Display QR with URL":["QR'\u0131 URL ile g\u00f6ster"],"title\u0004QR with URL and code":["URL ve kod i\u00e7eren QR"],"label\u0004Code Verification Value (CVV)":["Kod Do\u011frulama De\u011feri (CVV)"],"CVV attempts:":["CVV denemeleri:"],"Last attempt:":["Son deneme:"],"LOCKED \u2014 too many wrong attempts":["K\u0130L\u0130TLEND\u0130 \u2014 \u00e7ok fazla hatal\u0131 deneme"],"Reset CVV attempts":["CVV denemelerini s\u0131f\u0131rla"],"Reset CVV attempt counter and unlock this ticket?":["CVV deneme sayac\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rla ve bu biletin kilidini a\u00e7?"],"title\u0004WooCommerce Order":["WooCommerce Sipari\u015fi"],"WooCommerce not found":["WooCommerce bulunamadi"],"label\u0004Show in WooCommerce Orders":["WooCommerce Sipari\u015flerinde G\u00f6ster"],"label\u0004Order from":["\u015euradan sipari\u015f"],"label\u0004Order Status":["Sipari\u015f Durumu"],"label\u0004Billing Email":["Fatura E-postas\u0131"],"label\u0004Product Id":["\u00dcr\u00fcn Kimli\u011fi"],"label\u0004Show Product":["\u00dcr\u00fcn\u00fc G\u00f6ster"],"label\u0004Product":["\u00dcr\u00fcn"],"label\u0004Variation":["Varyasyon"],"Related Subscriptions":["\u0130lgili Abonelikler"],"label\u0004Subscription Id":["Abonelik Kimli\u011fi"],"label\u0004Show Subscription":["Aboneli\u011fi G\u00f6ster"],"label\u0004Delete WooCommerce order info for this ticket":["Bu bilet i\u00e7in WooCommerce sipari\u015f bilgilerini sil"],"title\u0004Remove order":["Sipari\u015fi kald\u0131r"],"Do you really want to remove your order information of this ticket \"%s\"? This will also remove the ticket number from the order! For the PREMIUM PLUGIN: It will only remove it from the position of the order. If you have in one order more than one item with ticket number, then it will only remove the ticket number(s) from this item on the order. For the BASIC PLUGIN, it will remove all tickets from all items on this order. Click OK to proceed the removal.":["Bu bilete ait \"%s\" sipari\u015f bilginizi kald\u0131rmak istedi\u011finizden emin misiniz? Bu, sipari\u015ften bilet numaras\u0131n\u0131 da kald\u0131racakt\u0131r! PREMIUM EKLENT\u0130 i\u00e7in: Bilet yaln\u0131zca sipari\u015fteki konumundan kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r. Bir sipari\u015fte bilet numaras\u0131 i\u00e7eren birden fazla \u00f6\u011feniz varsa, yaln\u0131zca o \u00f6\u011fedeki bilet numaralar\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r. TEMEL EKLENT\u0130 i\u00e7in, bu sipari\u015fteki t\u00fcm \u00f6\u011felerden t\u00fcm biletler kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r. Kald\u0131rma i\u015flemine devam etmek i\u00e7in Tamam'a t\u0131klay\u0131n."],"WooCommerce ticket sale":["WooCommerce bilet sat\u0131\u015f\u0131"],"WooCommerce Purchase Restriction":["WooCommerce satin alma kisitlamasi"],"label\u0004Used for Order ID":["Sipari\u015f Kimli\u011fi i\u00e7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r"],"label\u0004Open WooCommerce Order":["WooCommerce Sipari\u015fini A\u00e7"],"Remove purchase ticket information":["Sat\u0131n alma bilet bilgisini kald\u0131r"],"Do you really want to remove the purchase ticket information from the order of this ticket \"%s\"? This will remove the also the ticket(s) from the order items! This ticket can then be reused for purchases. Click OK to proceed the removal.":["Bu bilete ait \"%s\" sipari\u015finin sat\u0131n alma bilet bilgisini kald\u0131rmak istedi\u011finizden emin misiniz? Bu, sipari\u015f \u00f6\u011felerinden bilet(ler)i de kald\u0131racakt\u0131r! Bu bilet daha sonra sat\u0131n alma i\u015flemleri i\u00e7in yeniden kullan\u0131labilir. Kald\u0131rma i\u015flemine devam etmek i\u00e7in Tamam'a t\u0131klay\u0131n."],"title\u0004Registered user":["Kay\u0131tl\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131"],"title\u0004IP list checked for this ticket":["Bu bilet i\u00e7in kontrol edilen IP listesi"],"title\u0004Error":["Hata"],"Redeemed via authtoken:":["authtoken \u00fczerinden kullan\u0131ld\u0131:"],"label\u0004Congress":["Kongre"],"label\u0004Open congress page":["Kongre sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7"],"Wallet Test":["C\u00fczdan Testi"],"Import ticket to Vollstart Wallet for testing":["Test i\u00e7in bileti Vollstart C\u00fczdan'a aktar"],"option\u0004Remove marked as used":["Kullan\u0131ld\u0131 i\u015faretini kald\u0131r"],"option\u0004Delete Redeem Information":["Kullan\u0131m Bilgilerini Sil"],"option\u0004Generate ticket PDF":["Bilet PDF'si olu\u015ftur"],"option\u0004Generate badge ticket":["Yaka rozeti bileti olu\u015ftur"],"option\u0004Move to ticket list":["Bilet listesine git"],"label\u0004Assign selected tickets to this ticket list":["Se\u00e7ilen biletleri bu bilet listesine ata"]}}}